---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Base
  title="Email from Steve to Himself | Elisa Diop-Weyer"
  description="An excerpt from Make Something Wonderful by Steve Jobs."
>
  <article class="email-page">
    <a class="back-link" href={`${base}/musings/`}>← Selected Inputs</a>

    <header>
      <h1>Email from Steve to Himself</h1>
      <p class="subject">[No Subject]</p>
      <dl>
        <dt>From:</dt><dd>Steve Jobs</dd>
        <dt>To:</dt><dd>Steve Jobs</dd>
        <dt>Subject:</dt><dd></dd>
        <dt>Date:</dt><dd>September 2, 2010, 11:08 p.m.</dd>
      </dl>
    </header>

    <div class="message">
      <p>I grow little of the food I eat, and of the little I do grow I did not breed or perfect the seeds.</p>
      <p>I do not make any of my own clothing.</p>
      <p>I speak a language I did not invent or refine.</p>
      <p>I did not discover the mathematics I use.</p>
      <p>I am protected by freedoms and laws I did not conceive of or legislate, and do not enforce or adjudicate.</p>
      <p>I am moved by music I did not create myself.</p>
      <p>When I needed medical attention, I was helpless to help myself survive.</p>
      <p>I did not invent the transistor, the microprocessor, object oriented programming, or most of the technology I work with.</p>
      <p>I love and admire my species, living and dead, and am totally dependent on them for my life and well being.</p>
      <p>Sent from my iPad</p>
    </div>

    <footer>
      Excerpt from <a href="https://book.stevejobsarchive.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><cite>Make Something Wonderful</cite></a> by Steve Jobs.
    </footer>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .email-page {
    width: min(100%, 42rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8em;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .back-link:hover,
  .back-link:focus-visible {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  h1 {
    font-style: italic;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .subject {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  dl {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.05rem 0.65rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 2.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .message p {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8em;
  }
</style>
